5/2018/2020/2022/2023中，它几乎没有一次干净地领先风险资产的瀑布式下跌；盈亏平衡速度对前瞻回撤几乎没有预测力，信用/波动率联动相对VIX无增量。用它来辨别正在发生的变动（属于哪一类下跌），而非抢跑。"}},"inflation_decomposition":{"headline_minus_core":0.24,"food_energy_note":{"en":"headline above core = food/energy adding; below = subtracting","zh":"整体高于核心＝食品/能源在推升；低于＝在拖累"},"core_services_yoy":4.03,"shelter_yoy":3.97,"services_minus_shelter":0.07,"pce_minus_cpi":-0.07,"actual_vs_market_bp":116.0,"actual_vs_market_note":{"en":"realized core CPI vs the 10y breakeven the market prices","zh":"已实现核心CPI vs 市场定价的10年期盈亏平衡"}},"transmission":{},"headwinds":[],"tailwinds":[],"chains":[{"id":"real_rate","title":{"en":"Real-rate / discount-rate channel","zh":"实际利率／贴现率传导"},"trigger":"real10y_chg63","trigger_label":"Real 10y — 63d change (speed)","active":false,"trigger_z":0.06,"trigger_dir":"up","orders":[{"order":1,"text":{"en":"Rising real 10y yields lift the discount rate → long-duration equities, REITs and other long-duration assets de-rate first.","zh":"实际10年期收益率上行抬高贴现率→长久期股票、REITs等长久期资产首先承压。"},"assets":[{"asset":"QQQ","label":"Nasdaq 100 (long-duration growth)","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"},{"asset":"XLK","label":"Technology","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"},{"asset":"XLRE","label":"Real Estate (rate-sensitive)","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"},{"asset":"TLT","label":"Long Treasuries (20y+)","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"},{"asset":"BTC-USD","label":"Bitcoin (long-duration)","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"}]},{"order":2,"text":{"en":"Higher US real yields pull capital in → the dollar firms → gold, industrial commodities and EM are pressured.","zh":"美国实际收益率走高吸引资本流入→美元走强→黄金、工业商品与新兴市场受压。"},"assets":[{"asset":"DX-Y.NYB","label":"US Dollar (DXY)","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"},{"asset":"GC=F","label":"Gold","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"},{"asset":"HG=F","label":"Copper","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"},{"asset":"CL=F","label":"Oil (WTI)","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"},{"asset":"FXI","label":"China large-cap (EM proxy)","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"}]},{"order":3,"text":{"en":"A firm dollar + soft commodities → energy/materials relative headwind and EM-revenue exporters de-rate; financials are the relative beneficiary as curves steepen.","zh":"强美元＋商品走软→能源/材料相对承压、新兴市场营收型出口商估值下修；曲线变陡时金融为相对受益者。"},"assets":[{"asset":"XLE","label":"Energy (inflation beneficiary)","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"},{"asset":"XLB","label":"Materials (inflation beneficiary)","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"},{"asset":"XLF","label":"Financials (rate beneficiary)","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"}]}]},{"id":"sticky_inflation","title":{"en":"Sticky-inflation / higher-for-longer channel","zh":"通胀粘性／更高更久传导"},"trigger":"corepce_gap","trigger_label":"Core PCE YoY − 2% target","active":false,"trigger_z":0.41,"trigger_dir":"up","orders":[{"order":1,"text":{"en":"Core PCE/CPI stuck above the 2% target → the market reprices the terminal rate higher (breakevens, policy path) → broad equities carry a valuation headwind.","zh":"核心PCE/CPI高于2%目标→市场上修终端利率（盈亏平衡、政策路径）→大盘股估值承压。"},"assets":[{"asset":"SPY","label":"S&P 500","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"},{"asset":"QQQ","label":"Nasdaq 100 (long-duration growth)","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"}]},{"order":2,"text":{"en":"Higher-for-longer keeps real yields elevated → small caps and rate-sensitive borrowers are squeezed by financing cost.","zh":"更高更久使实际收益率维持高位→小盘股与利率敏感借款方被融资成本挤压。"},"assets":[{"asset":"IWM","label":"Russell 2000 (small caps)","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"},{"asset":"XLF","label":"Financials (rate beneficiary)","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"}]},{"order":3,"text":{"en":"PPI / ECI wage pressure compresses margins → defensives (staples, health care) relatively outperform.","zh":"PPI／就业成本（ECI）工资压力压缩利润率→防御板块（必需消费、医疗）相对跑赢。"},"assets":[{"asset":"XLP","label":"Staples (defensive)","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"},{"asset":"XLV","label":"Health Care (defensive)","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"}]}]},{"id":"policy_easing","title":{"en":"Policy-easing / curve-steepening channel","zh":"政策宽松／曲线变陡传导"},"trigger":"curve_tp_adj","trigger_label":"Legacy TP10 curve heuristic","active":true,"trigger_z":1.75,"trigger_dir":"up","orders":[{"order":1,"text":{"en":"Cuts priced (policy gap negative) → the front end falls and the curve bull-steepens → duration rallies.","zh":"计入降息（政策缺口为负）→短端下行、曲线牛市变陡→久期资产上涨。"},"assets":[{"asset":"TLT","label":"Long Treasuries (20y+)","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"}]},{"order":2,"text":{"en":"A steeper curve → bank net-interest margins and rate-sensitive REITs/housing improve.","zh":"曲线变陡→银行净息差与利率敏感的REITs/地产改善。"},"assets":[{"asset":"XLF","label":"Financials (rate beneficiary)","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"},{"asset":"XLRE","label":"Real Estate (rate-sensitive)","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"}]},{"order":3,"text":{"en":"Easier financial conditions → small caps and cyclicals lead a risk-on rotation.","zh":"金融条件转松→小盘与周期股领涨的风险偏好轮动。"},"assets":[{"asset":"IWM","label":"Russell 2000 (small caps)","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"},{"asset":"XLB","label":"Materials (inflation beneficiary)","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"}]}]},{"id":"expectations","title":{"en":"Inflation-expectations (anchoring) channel","zh":"通胀预期（锚定）传导"},"trigger":"exp_wedge","trigger_label":"Expectations wedge (mkt − model)","active":true,"trigger_z":-1.2,"trigger_dir":"down","orders":[{"order":1,"text":{"en":"Market inflation expectations drift above the model/survey → unanchoring risk; the dollar firms as the Fed is expected to stay restrictive. Counter-intuitively, gold's MEASURED response to this wedge is a headwind — the higher real yields from a restrictive Fed dominate the inflation-hedge bid.","zh":"市场通胀预期高于模型/调查→脱锚风险；美元因预期美联储维持紧缩而走强。与直觉相反，黄金对此缺口的实测反应为逆风——紧缩带来的更高实际收益率压过了通胀对冲买盘。"},"assets":[{"asset":"DX-Y.NYB","label":"US Dollar (DXY)","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"},{"asset":"GC=F","label":"Gold","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"}]},{"order":2,"text":{"en":"Unanchoring → the Fed stays restrictive → real yields rise; long-duration growth de-rates while defensives are relatively favored.","zh":"脱锚→美联储维持紧缩→实际收益率上行；长久期成长下修，防御相对受青睐。"},"assets":[{"asset":"QQQ","label":"Nasdaq 100 (long-duration growth)","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"},{"asset":"XLV","label":"Health Care (defensive)","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"}]},{"order":3,"text":{"en":"The textbook 'real-asset hedge' (energy, materials, gold) is unreliable for this wedge: with the Fed held restrictive, the measured beneficiaries are the dollar and defensives, not the inflation-beneficiary sectors.","zh":"教科书式的“实物资产对冲”（能源、材料、黄金）对此缺口并不可靠：在美联储维持紧缩下，实测受益者是美元与防御板块，而非通胀受益板块。"},"assets":[{"asset":"XLE","label":"Energy (inflation beneficiary)","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"},{"asset":"XLB","label":"Materials (inflation beneficiary)","ic":null,"effect":"—","verdict":"UNMEASURED"}]}]}],"scenarios":[],"scored_status":{"en":"Display-only. Scored-leg gate: NO rate/inflation leg passed the forward-drawdown bar with purged-CV robustness (see reports/rate-inflation-transmission-calibration.md).","zh":"仅供展示。可计分腿检验：没有任何利率/通胀腿通过前瞻回撤门槛并满足清洗交叉验证稳健性（详见校准报告）。"},"caveats":[{"en":"Display-only — never scored. The repricing of rates/inflation is REACTIVE; the curve moves after the data and the Fed, it does not lead them.","zh":"仅供展示，从不计入评分。利率/通胀的重新定价是被动的；曲线在数据与美联储之后变动，而非领先。"},{"en":"Rate-of-change beats level: the SPEED of a real-yield move breaks equities more than its level. Coefficients are the measured forward IC, not a promise.","zh":"变动速度比水平更重要：实际收益率移动的速度比其水平更能冲击股票。系数为已测得的前瞻IC，并非承诺。"},{"en":"Scenario moves apply a historical beta to a hypothetical shock — they are regime-dependent illustrations, not predictions, and assume the shock persists one quarter.","zh":"情景中的涨跌幅是将历史beta应用于假设冲击——属于依赖状态的示意而非预测，且假设冲击持续一个季度。"},{"en":"The real / nominal / breakeven 63d-change drivers are mechanically collinear (real = nominal − breakeven); do not treat them as independent confirmations.","zh":"实际／名义／盈亏平衡的63日变动驱动在机制上共线（实际＝名义−盈亏平衡）；不应视为相互独立的印证。"}],"calibrated":false}